  "reject_note": "Bytes a conforming implementation MUST REFUSE to ingest (SPEC 1). Positive vectors alone cannot establish conformance: two implementations agreeing on well-formed records say nothing about whether they accept the SAME domain, and an implementation that accepts everything passes every positive vector. class=not-ijson is the group that actually splits implementations (valid JSON that I-JSON forbids); class=not-json fails in any correct parser and is here so a failure can be told apart from a strictness gap."
